    "detailed_description": "Pro Wrestling Sim is a text-based pro-wrestling booking simulator. Control a wrestling promotion, decide your roster, and create storylines, feuds and matches where the winners and losers are in your hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><strong>Promises</strong><br>Your workers will request that you make promises to them. This can be asking for a match with a worker, asking for a title shot, or even a title win. Agree to make a promise and you better deliver - you don't want to upset your top star or his friends!<br><br><strong>Edit Database</strong><br>With the Edit Database functionality, you can design, build and grow a world of your own creation, based on reality or your own imagination, and share it with friends.",
